[00:00.00]Good morning, Grandma! What are you doing?|早上好，奶奶！你在做什么呀？
[00:05.00]Good morning, baby. I'm getting water.|早上好，宝贝。我在打水。
[00:10.00]I am going to wash clothes.|我要洗衣服。
[00:13.00]Wash clothes? Can I help you?|洗衣服？我可以帮忙吗？
[00:17.00]Yes. Come and help me.|好呀，过来帮我。
[00:20.00]One, two, step with me, sweetie.|一、二，跟着我踩，宝贝。
[00:23.00]Sweetie|宝贝。
[00:31.62]Now rub the clothes rub rub like this|现在搓衣服，搓呀搓，像这样。
[00:38.32]Yes, very good. Let's rinse the clothes splash splash they're clean now ring them dry|对，很好。我们把衣服漂一漂，哗啦哗啦，现在干净了，把它们拧干。
[00:50.22]Let me wipe your face|我来给你擦擦脸。
[00:53.00]Splash! Now you are wet!|哗！这下你湿啦！
[00:56.00]Oh, you naughty girl!|哦，你这个小淘气！
[01:03.00]Look! All the clothes are hung up!|你看！衣服都晾起来了！
[01:08.00]The sun will dry them soon.|太阳很快就晒干了。
[01:13.00]I love washing with you, Grandma.|我喜欢跟你一起洗衣服，奶奶。
[01:16.00]I love you too, baby.|我也爱你，宝贝。
